  Mode: 115
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Den Builder
  Description: 'Goby and Pistol only - a timed build. From the Goby, dart and perch to lay the
    Pistol''s islands. From the Pistol, jump the hills - every trail block you fly over is
    energy, and a fall loses it - and rest at each perch to build a den from it. Grazers eat
    whatever stands outside the core, and rival rings smash it. Higher intensities bring
    more grazers and fewer crystals. The team with the most mass standing at the whistle
    wins.'
